Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:10.91,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:17.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.99,0:00:23.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:29.83,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:46.45,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:53.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:59.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:05.57,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:12.44,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.91,0:01:23.25,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.26,0:01:39.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先是不小心得了感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着又为草太的恋情奔波
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.03,0:01:43.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然前前后后花了不少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总算和犬夜叉一起又回到了战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:50.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见啦 草太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.77,0:01:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就走咯 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第91话 怪异的巫师和黑色云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:05.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在总算可以定下心来寻找奈落的行踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.85,0:02:08.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近这段时间一直在忙一些无聊事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.55,0:02:10.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是对不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:12.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家感冒得那么严重
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:14.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不过是件无聊事嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.73,0:02:17.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉…真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛要胡说八道自讨苦吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:21.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:23.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真拿他没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:27.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次说过 奈落是往丑寅方向溜走的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:29.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这个地方看过去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:30.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是那边才对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:32.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:33.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家不要拖拖拉拉的了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.91,0:02:35.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧赶路 走咯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:38.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 这次一定要抓到你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:40.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要走那么快啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:53.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位村民
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:55.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大神再度降下旨意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:58.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叉尾猫会给全村带来不幸哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:02:59.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叉尾猫指的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.27,0:03:02.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说猫如果有两条尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:04.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就代表拥有妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.14,0:03:07.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果大家不把这只叉尾猫赶出村外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子里一定会大祸临头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.19,0:03:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下 下次别再让我看见你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死叉尾猫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.77,0:03:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:30.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:32.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:35.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:36.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:37.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要跑去哪里啊？云母
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 到底跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.69,0:03:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:52.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:04.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 真是清爽啊 小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:10.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱的女生哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是听见这个女生 的叫声所以跑来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.15,0:04:14.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 原来你跑到这里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害我担心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.19,0:04:23.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 快点过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.19,0:04:24.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好乖好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:30.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你太好了 小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.03,0:04:33.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫不叫作小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:35.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的名字叫作云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:36.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 我帮你戴铃铛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:38.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是珊瑚养的爱猫啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 铃铛戴好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:46.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么跟我回家吧 小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.71,0:04:47.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跟你说了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不叫作小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.21,0:04:50.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫作云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.45,0:04:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家又过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:55.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快点跑吧 小花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 千万不能被他们抓到哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跟你说了她叫云母嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然长得可爱 但是是个奇怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:06.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你们看 就是那只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.07,0:05:14.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明应该被我们赶到村外去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:20.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死猫 快滚 你这只死猫 快滚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.41,0:05:22.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 住手 你们想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:24.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快滚 痛死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下啦 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.19,0:05:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在人面前不要随便变身啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:30.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:33.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个家伙 难道跟猫怪是一伙的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说谁是猫怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别发火 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:41.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事交给我来处理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.10,0:05:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位叔叔伯伯 动用暴力是不对的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:50.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果好好坐下来谈一定可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:52.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些该死的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.51,0:05:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别生气别生气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人 冷静一点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.55,0:05:59.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能再做这种 粗暴的事下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:06.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说 九命怪猫有仇记七世的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.06,0:06:09.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这只猫并不是小花
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:16.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村民们对你们这么没礼貌实在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:18.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是没什么关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:20.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过话又说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的村民 怎么会这么讨厌一只小猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:25.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:29.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:30.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚那个小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她那么喜欢云母
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.05,0:06:36.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定是个心地善良的小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:43.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子里有一只很聪明的小猫叫小花
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:46.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们全都跟她感情非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:48.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直到几天前
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个云游各地很厉害的巫师来到我们村子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:53.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟全村的人说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叉尾猫将会给村民们带来不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:06:59.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我们马上把她赶出村子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:02.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得刚刚那个小姑娘会把云母当成小花呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:09.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我知道这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很对不起村里的小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:14.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是大家都怕村子真的发生了什么不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:17.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过一只猫就能够带来灾难这种说法…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:20.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这个巫师有点可疑耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:23.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们有必要会会他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:25.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我也这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:31.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:33.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会太久没有吃过好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.71,0:07:35.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一下吃太多吃坏肚子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:44.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道要去哪里才能找到刚刚那位小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:47.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:52.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不就是刚刚那位小姑娘吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:07:58.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:00.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是你的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.14,0:08:03.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:05.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚被你戴上铃铛的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你走丢的那只小花
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是另一只猫 叫做云母
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.65,0:08:14.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在找一只叫做小花的猫对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.25,0:08:18.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我陪你一起找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:22.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫小梅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:24.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅？好好听的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:42.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（念咒声）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.19,0:08:55.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是 七宝这家伙跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:57.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得他有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:01.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看 那边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是妖气漂浮聚集而形成的云
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子这个巫师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果真不是个简单的人物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:10.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动作得快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:13.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚村长说他应该 就在村子尽头的小庙里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:17.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:25.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:27.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:29.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来应该不在这边喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定很喜欢那只猫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:37.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.57,0:09:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花肚子里已经怀了小宝宝了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:43.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.57,0:09:44.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会帮你把小花找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:49.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.35,0:09:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们再往里面找找看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:09:58.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 这股妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.51,0:10:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 震荡陀螺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:23.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快抓紧我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:27.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要逃到更高的地方去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是老鼠 成群结队的老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:49.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.24,0:10:53.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:55.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:57.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得赶紧求菩萨保佑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.79,0:11:08.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个村子都是些愚不可及的笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:11.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后这个村子不会再有我们最怕的猫了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:13.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然叉尾猫不在这
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:14.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟我的老鼠兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:16.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就会抢光整个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:18.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着吃光整个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.15,0:11:28.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:29.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快要跑不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:33.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 她就是小花
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道它也有两条尾巴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 你来救我的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.97,0:11:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:51.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:53.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是利用妖气创造出来的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.01,0:11:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个巫师应该是妖怪变身的了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:11:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只死妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种结界我一刀就把你打烂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.85,0:12:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.93,0:12:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:32.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现身啦 你这只笨鼠怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:34.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.35,0:12:36.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该是个半妖吧 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:38.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是个半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:40.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然也敢跟我铁鼠大爷作对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:48.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…是猫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:51.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长得人高马大 居然会怕一只猫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:55.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才要赶走小朋友所喜欢的猫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:57.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只可恶的老鼠怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:59.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本大爷这就来收拾你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:01.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是一只专说大话的混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.72,0:13:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢呵呵 你这只半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.32,0:13:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过就这么点本事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.69,0:13:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说风之伤也收拾不了他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:20.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？终于知道害怕了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.49,0:13:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这根本不是妖怪的原形
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:25.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:26.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕是鼠辈的妖气集结起来的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:31.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你用刀砍他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕都不见得有用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.27,0:13:35.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那到底该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.01,0:13:37.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来收拾他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.28,0:13:39.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要使出风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:42.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一口气吸光这些鼠辈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:45.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖气消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被他跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:03.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得小花想要带我们去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:15.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.55,0:14:17.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的小宝宝都平安没事耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.29,0:14:24.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:27.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起回村子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:31.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后谁都不能再把我们分开了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:36.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻到了闻到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:38.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是人类小孩的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:40.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果吃了这些孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:45.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们老鼠怪的妖力马上可以增强一倍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:48.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 别追出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.65,0:14:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候追出去恐怕会有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:56.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外头让小花应付就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.36,0:14:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们帮她保护好孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:15.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙 你就非死缠着本大爷是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅 你千万不可以离开这里喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:25.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.69,0:15:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不怕死的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:33.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本大爷今天就要你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.89,0:15:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咿呀 放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.13,0:15:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真棒耶 小花
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.57,0:15:42.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.93,0:15:45.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尝尝我的铁鼠幻术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 小梅
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.37,0:16:19.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过出口好像被堵住了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:24.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会想办法救你们出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:31.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边应该就是出口了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:44.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:46.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:56.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛不痛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:01.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:02.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是死不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:07.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只可恶的老鼠怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.35,0:17:08.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就这样怕了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃离这个村子了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:11.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老鼠怪好不容易才把这个村的猫赶走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他不会那么容易放弃这个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.73,0:17:17.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…它还在村子附近活动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:18.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.96,0:17:20.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是小花
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:23.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么那只叉尾猫又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:25.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快过去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:28.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快…快点找…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:30.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:37.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是 七宝带在身上的铃铛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来 难道这只猫就是小花了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:41.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子好像受伤不轻耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:50.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫看起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像想带我们去什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:07.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸…好难受…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:09.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快要可以出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:11.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再忍耐一下 小梅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:20.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再一下下就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:21.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要撑下去 小梅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:24.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要撑下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:46.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:48.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅 我成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是妖怪吧 快点让开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.06,0:18:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里面一定有人类的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个小孩我今天吃定了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.67,0:19:03.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会让你称心如意的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:05.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开 去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他脸上没有小花抓的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:14.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.85,0:19:18.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然靠吃人类小孩来增加妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.08,0:19:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事亏你做得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:21.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:25.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘了你那把剑根本奈何不了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.59,0:19:28.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只妖怪是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:30.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他脸上没有被小花抓过的伤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:33.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:48.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 看看后面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.45,0:19:49.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,攻击那块岩石
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:53.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你的原形在那里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:08.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:12.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:15.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:18.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花她…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.31,0:20:19.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己身上受了伤都不顾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:23.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拼命想把你们的消息传给我们知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:29.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.15,0:20:31.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:42.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们大家 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:44.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢… 你们的大恩大德救了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅 保重哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.89,0:21:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小朋友们 吃饭时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:20.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后我们一定要一直在一起哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:21.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小花
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.71,0:21:26.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次你好像很卖力哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.15,0:21:30.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小梅全都说给我们听了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:34.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 男子汉大丈夫本来就应该保护女生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:37.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最伟大的是连一点私心都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:40.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真想把这句话说给某人听啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.19,0:21:42.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.93,0:21:45.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你其实是喜欢上那个叫小梅的姑娘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.23,0:21:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实就是这么回事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.23,0:21:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是不是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:53.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你生气的话 那就是欲盖弥彰喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.74,0:21:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就说了不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.74,0:21:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉你又欺负我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:21:58.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:21:59.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:00.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.45,0:22:05.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又怎么了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天气不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.66,0:22:18.90,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:28.71,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.98,0:22:37.95,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:47.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.50,0:22:52.87,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.24,0:22:57.77,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.01,0:23:05.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:11.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.03,0:23:15.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.33,0:23:23.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:33.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.73,0:23:48.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.03,0:23:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有里陶用的那些药草的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.67,0:23:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的里陶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.70,0:23:54.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个让桔梗复活的妖婆吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.07,0:23:56.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到桔梗留下的香味
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.07,0:24:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道…桔梗她控制了里陶那些部队了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.77,0:24:01.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.78,0:24:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道还有利用人的魂魄制作陶俑这种事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.41,0:24:08.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.64,0:24:10.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,复活者的野心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.62,0:24:13.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说里陶到现在还没死
